The key issue is **test isolation**. Each test calls `resetProtectionStore()` which does `rm -rf` on the entire `investor-protection` directory. When tests run in parallel (bun runs test files in parallel), one test's `rm -rf` can wipe another test's data.

But wait - all these tests are in the SAME file `ivx-investor-protection.test.ts`. Bun runs tests within a single file sequentially, not in parallel. So tests within the same file shouldn't interfere with each other... unless there's a race condition.

Actually, looking more carefully at the CI logs:

